# Runtime source contract: Identity/Health only. No DM endpoint in P0.
# Get the manifest and login using dm-acceptance.ps1; keep tokens in memory.
# An editor's REST Client may display tokens locally; never export its history into Git.
@api = http://localhost:15026/api/v1
@webApi = http://localhost:15300/api/v1
@accessToken = replace-with-your-current-A-token-locally
@refreshToken = replace-with-your-current-A-refresh-token-locally

### Health, expected 200; Messaging stage Foundation
GET {{api}}/health

### Same health through the frontend proxy, expected 200
GET {{webApi}}/health

### No token, expected 401 Common.Unauthorized
GET {{api}}/users/me

### Login A, expected 200; raw token output is local only
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"dm_demo_an","password":"DmDemo2026!Local","deviceName":"DM-manual-A"}

### Current A, expected 200 / username dm_demo_an
GET {{api}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save profile, expected 200; read GET me again and compare bio
PATCH {{api}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"An Demo","bio":"Kiểm tra hồ sơ DM-P0-T01-C01","locale":"vi-VN","timezone":"Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"}

### Pending U, expected 403 Identity.EmailNotVerified, no auth tokens
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"dm_demo_pending","password":"DmDemo2026!Local","deviceName":"DM-manual-U"}

### Logout this A session, expected 204; GET me with same accessToken now401
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Token from the revoked A session, expected 401
GET {{api}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
